          "x": 126,
          "z": 372
        },
        {
          "name": "the east shore camp",
          "x": 338,
          "z": 428
        }
      ],
      "residents": [
        {
          "id": "henry_becker",
          "name": "Henry Becker",
          "kind": "farmer",
          "home": "basswood_farm",
          "talk": [
            "This was the first quarry in the islands. Now it's my sheep that walk the cut.",
            "Oats and potatoes. We take them across to Bayfield in the skiff.",
            "There's a watch on the Bayfield dock now. Times are getting harder for some."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "will_becker",
          "name": "Will Becker",
          "kind": "farmer",
          "home": "basswood_farm",
          "round": [
            {
              "x": 270,
              "z": 300
            }
          ],
          "talk": [
            "Pa wants the north field cleared before snow. Stumps, stumps and more stumps.",
            "You can see clear to Madeline from the top of the island."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "tom_ryan",
          "name": "Tom Ryan",
          "kind": "fisherman",
          "home": "basswood_fish_camp",
          "talk": [
            "Whitefish, mostly, and a few trout. Sells better in Duluth, if you can get it there.",
            "A boat out of Bayfield looks in here now and then. The marshal's, I'd say."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "reporting": "slow"
    }
  },
